# Component Development Rules

This file provides an overview of component patterns. For detailed guidance, see the domain-specific rule files below.

## Domain-Specific Rule Files

| File | Description | Globs |
|------|-------------|-------|
| **ui-patterns.mdc** | shadcn/ui usage, styling, Tailwind, animations | `src/components/**/*.tsx` |
| **movie-series.mdc** | Movie/series components, hero sections, cards, badges | `src/components/features/movie/**`, `series/**`, `media/**` |
| **person-components.mdc** | Person page components, filmography, credits filtering | `src/components/features/person/**` |
| **discover-components.mdc** | Browse/filter components, scrollers, homepage sections | `src/components/features/discover/**`, `home/**` |
| **admin-components.mdc** | Admin dashboard, analytics charts, monitoring | `src/components/features/admin/**` |
| **layout-components.mdc** | Nav, footer, hover cards, search command | `src/components/features/layout/**`, `search/**`, `hover-card/**` |

## Feature Components Directory Structure

```
src/components/
├── ui/                        # shadcn/ui components (DO NOT MODIFY)
└── features/                  # Domain-specific components
    ├── movie/                 # Movie cards, carousel, logo
    ├── series/                # Season selector, episode modal
    ├── media/                 # Shared movie/series components (hero, ratings, scroller)
    ├── person/                # Person hero, filmography, known-for
    ├── discover/              # Filter sidebar, discover grid, scrollers
    ├── home/                  # Homepage sections, trailers, personalized content
    ├── hover-card/            # Netflix-style hover card system
    ├── search/                # Search command dialog
    ├── layout/                # Nav, footer, mobile nav, country selector
    ├── auth/                  # Login, user menu, Google One Tap
    ├── admin/                 # Analytics dashboard, charts
    ├── ai/                    # AI chat, quick take, mood indicators
    └── providers/             # App-wide providers (auth, theme, query)
```

## Core Principles

### 1. DO NOT modify `src/components/ui/`

These are generated by shadcn CLI. To customize:
- Override styles with Tailwind classes when using the component
- Create wrapper components in `src/components/features/`
- Use CSS variables for theming

### 2. Composition over Configuration

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD: Composable
<Card>
  <CardHeader><CardTitle>{movie.title}</CardTitle></CardHeader>
  <CardContent><MoviePoster src={movie.posterPath} /></CardContent>
</Card>

// ❌ BAD: Over-configured
<MovieCard title={movie.title} poster={movie.posterPath} showHeader={true} />
```

### 3. Client/Server Component Split

```tsx
// movie-card.tsx (Server Component by default)
import { MovieCardActions } from "./movie-card-actions";

export function MovieCard({ movie }) {
  return (
    <Card>
      <MoviePoster movie={movie} />
      <MovieCardActions movieId={movie.id} /> {/* Client boundary */}
    </Card>
  );
}

// movie-card-actions.tsx (Client Component)
"use client";
export function MovieCardActions({ movieId }) {
  const { toggleWatchlist } = useUserStore();
  return <Button onClick={() => toggleWatchlist(movieId)}>Add</Button>;
}
```

### 4. Use CDN Images with TMDB Fallback

```tsx
import { getPosterSources, getBackdropSources } from "@/lib/image";

const sources = getPosterSources(item, "movie");
// { primary: CDN URL, fallback: TMDB URL }
```

### 5. Always Provide Loading States

```tsx
export function MovieCardSkeleton() {
  return (
    <Card>
      <Skeleton className="aspect-[2/3] w-full rounded-lg" />
      <Skeleton className="h-4 w-3/4 mt-2" />
    </Card>
  );
}
```

## Quick Reference

### Card Sizing Patterns

```tsx
// Poster cards in scrollers
className="w-[130px] sm:w-[145px] md:w-[160px] flex-shrink-0"

// Wide cards in scrollers
className="w-[220px] sm:w-[260px] md:w-[300px] flex-shrink-0"

// Cast cards (smaller)
className="w-[110px] sm:w-[125px] md:w-[140px] flex-shrink-0"
```

### Grid Layouts

```tsx
// Poster grid (7 columns max)
className="grid grid-cols-3 sm:grid-cols-4 md:grid-cols-5 lg:grid-cols-6 xl:grid-cols-7 gap-2.5"

// Wide card grid (5 columns max)
className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 xl:grid-cols-5 gap-4"
```

### MediaCard Usage

```tsx
import { MediaCard } from "@/components/features/movie/media-card";

// Respects user's poster/wide preference automatically
<MediaCard
  item={movie}
  className="w-[150px]"           // Poster mode sizing
  wideClassName="w-[300px]"       // Wide mode sizing
  showRating
  showBadges
  enableHover
  subtitle="Tony Stark"           // Optional character/role
  hideUserStatus                  // Hide on watchlist/watched pages
/>
```

### Scroller Usage

```tsx
import { MediaScroller, ScrollContainer } from "@/components/features/media";

// High-level scroller with header
<MediaScroller title="Top Cast" seeAllHref="/browse?cast=500">
  {cast.map(member => <PersonCard key={member.id} person={member} />)}
</MediaScroller>

// Low-level for custom UIs
<ScrollContainer showControls gap="gap-3" padding="px-4">
  {images.map((img) => <GalleryImage key={img.id} image={img} />)}
</ScrollContainer>
```

### Dialog Override Pattern

```tsx
// Default sm:max-w-lg must be overridden at sm breakpoint
<DialogContent className="sm:max-w-[95vw] md:max-w-[90vw] lg:max-w-5xl">
```

